      "cooked": "<p>A while back it was mentioned in various places that one of Tachyon's comic is her about to get punched by some dude, running off, getting something to eat (the artwork on her divider card) having a few more adventures, doing some experiements, then grabing a pipe and returning to the guy who was about to get her and hitting him first... so all of the comic takes place in about 5 seconds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Adam &nbsp;mentioned this in talking about time in the thread about all the comics. Someone else expanded on it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Well... That would be the image on Sucker Punch wouldn't it? Wonder who that guy is... Anyone have any more information?</p>",
